581 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 122 0 R/T(The SWOT analysis performed on the shop revealed that the most relevant strength is the fact that the entire merchandising is based on programs and TV series loved and followed by the public from home. All products are presented with a competitive price positioning. On the other hand, however, the weaknesses are also different: first of all, the brand image of the NBC Store is weak. Furthermore, the communication and promotion of the shop are not very effective. In this regard, the opportunities for the shop are among the most varied: using NBC's already high awareness to promote the store is one that would bring immediate results. Finally, among the threats, the strong competition should be kept an eye on.)/E(The SWOT analysis performed on the shop revealed that the most relevant strength is the fact that the entire merchandising is based on programs and TV series loved and followed by the public from home. All products are presented with a competitive price positioning. On the other hand, however, the weaknesses are also different: first of all, the brand image of the NBC Store is weak. Furthermore, the communication and promotion of the shop are not very effective. In this regard, the opportunities for the shop are among the most varied: using NBC's already high awareness to promote the store is one that would bring immediate results. Finally, among the threats, the strong competition should be kept an eye on.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[0]>>
