619 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(STRUTTURA: Make the history with US will be divided into three episodes, which remember highlights of the history of NBC and the United States. The timing will be between 00:45 seconds and 00:60 seconds. The three episodes are divided into: past, present and future.The first episode will concern the 60s and will try to convey the value of inclusiveness, the second episode is set in the present day and will try to promote change to create new opportunities, the third episode is set in the future where the individual is prodded to be the protagonist of the story himself, the value conveyed is NBC's core value, "inspiration", to create conversations and mobilize its audience to action to build a better world together.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

