636 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 128 0 R/T(To promote the Tour among tourists, partnerships will be made with the best travel agencies in Canada, UK, France, Brazil, China, Mexico, Australia, Germany, Italy and Spain \(from the data these are the most interesting markets to focus on \). Also will be identified travel angencies in New York and we don't exclude partnerships with travel agencies that have testimonials/influencers able to promote the tour themselves on their social channels \(for example Piero Armenti with "My trip to New York" for Italy\).Examples of agencies to contact that share the same values as NBC and are in line with the target are:)/E(To promote the Tour among tourists, partnerships will be made with the best travel agencies in Canada, UK, France, Brazil, China, Mexico, Australia, Germany, Italy and Spain \(from the data these are the most interesting markets to focus on \). Also will be identified travel angencies in New York and we don't exclude partnerships with travel agencies that have testimonials/influencers able to promote the tour themselves on their social channels \(for example Piero Armenti with "My trip to New York" for Italy\).Examples of agencies to contact that share the same values as NBC and are in line with the target are:)/Pg 36 0 R/K[3]>>
