642 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 128 0 R/E(The NBC Tour consists of a guided visit inside the Rockefeller Center in New York through the various studios that we find in the building. The tour will take place in small groups leaded by an NBC guide. The experience that we want to sell includes a journey through the history of NBC, you will pass through the corridors where the most representative images of these 96 years of history are found, you will enter the sets of Saturday Night Live, The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon, Late Night with Seth Meyers... The tour will end with an interactive experience, where attendees can produce and star in their own show.The NBC tour is currently interrupted, we have decided to relaunch it for this summer 2023 by adding new technologies \(such as VR and AR\) and supporting the launch with a digital corporate communication campaign \(storytelling\) and partnerships with travel agencies.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

