<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 129 0 R/T(The storytelling production will be the most expensive action, because in addition to the costs for the production and the editing, we will have to add the costs for the promotion. Even though, we think this is a feasible action and necessary to support all our future actions.  The event will required synergic and organizational ability from the staff, but his realization will not be difficult.  The tour at the NBC studios was already used in the past so it's  easily replicable.)/E(The storytelling production will be the most expensive action, because in addition to the costs for the production and the editing, we will have to add the costs for the promotion. Even though, we think this is a feasible action and necessary to support all our future actions.  The event will required synergic and organizational ability from the staff, but his realization will not be difficult.  The tour at the NBC studios was already used in the past so it's  easily replicable.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[40]>>
