698 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 130 0 R/T(To increase the traffic of people to the brick and mortar Shop we create an hunting game in New York City with selected influencers based on the target and their community. They will be playing in team with some of their followers \(or maybe all their social media community can help them during the game from home!\).  The game it's about a "peackooc hunt" with the final stop at the NBC shop. The aim of the game is to find the QRcode around the City. The QRcode to find will be six and they will shape the NBC logo.  The official NBC instagram page will give the first Clue, while the other clues will be unlock from the various QRcode.  The place that we will use for the hunt will be important places for the company history and touristic places. )/E(To increase the traffic of people to the brick and mortar Shop we create an hunting game in New York City with selected influencers based on the target and their community. They will be playing in team with some of their followers \(or maybe all their social media community can help them during the game from home!\).  The game it's about a "peackooc hunt" with the final stop at the NBC shop. The aim of the game is to find the QRcode around the City. The QRcode to find will be six and they will shape the NBC logo.  The official NBC instagram page will give the first Clue, while the other clues will be unlock from the various QRcode.  The place that we will use for the hunt will be important places for the company history and touristic places. )/Pg 38 0 R/K[10]>>
