endobj

889 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 141 0 R/E(Starting from the objectives given to us by NBC, we have proposed a series of actions to develop a Corporate part to increase the Marketing actions.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

890 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 141 0 R/E(We have proposed:)/Pg 49 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

891 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1897 0 R/E(A "corporate storytelling": we expect that thanks to this there will be an increase in corporate awareness and reputation.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

892 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1898 0 R/E(Organizing an event to demonstrate a company's excellence with travel agencies; we expect that thanks to them they can build relationships with commercial ends.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

893 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1899 0 R/E(Relaunch of the Tour at the NBC studios and the accompanying tale of values; to obtain an increase in corporate reputation and generate co-creation and interaction with users.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

894 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1900 0 R/E(The "Treasure Hunt" to obtain an increase in awareness in the long term and to increase the flow of people in the physical shop.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

895 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1901 0 R/E(The promotion of products through the guests of the shows, to increase the traffic of people passing through e-commerce.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

896 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1902 0 R/E(OOH Advertising to advertise the physical shop and thus increase the number of people therein.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

897 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1903 0 R/E(Promotion of the Tour on social media with "discount" operations  to increase attendance in the physical store and awareness.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

898 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 141 0 R/E(With the monitoring actions that we proposed, the agency will be able to avaluate the efficacy of the actions that we thought until the end of the 12 months. )/Pg 49 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

899 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 141 0 R/E(We have also estimated how much the share of people who will pass through the shop will increase compared to the data for 2022 \(97.4k\); we estimate that as a result of our actions there will be an increase of between 3-5%.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

900 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 142 0 R/T(12.1 CONCLUSIONS)/E(12.1 CONCLUSIONS)/Pg 50 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

901 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 142 0 R/E(There are some limits, like the different culture and data availability, but we think and we hope that the expected results can be fully realized.)/Pg 50 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

902 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 142 0 R/E(there was a good teamwork. We all worked together in order to carry out the analysis and planning of the work correctly.)/Pg 50 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

903 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 142 0 R/E(The biggest problem that emerged from the analysis was that people don't know the NBC store inside the Rockefeller Center and they don't know the website on the internet. For that reason we choose some actions that may can increase the awareness in the shop, trying to use marketing and corporate strategies.)/Pg 50 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

904 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 142 0 R/E(Another fact that emerged from the analysis is that in communication on social media, NBC adopts the metaphor of the "sounding board", for this reason we have tried to stimulate the pro-activity of users through Treasure Hunt's mktg mix operation. This will not involve passing from one metaphor to another but will encourage forms of engagement.)/Pg 50 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

