<</Title(After the analysis on competitors, what emerged is the disadvantage, for the e-commerce of NBC shop, of not selling outside America. Compared, on the other hand, to the physical shop, the biggest disadvantage is the unfunctional geographical location of the NBC store: unlike competitors, it is not very visible in the eyes of tourists, as it is located inside the Rockefeller Center, rather than on the street, where millions of people walk every day. As for the tie points, we found that NBC meets the core needs of the competing product.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2845 0 R>>
endobj

